  <synonym>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>TM11, PA2 and EM2 objects </value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>اشیای TM11، PA2 و EM2</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Oggetti УТ11, КА2, УП2</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Obiekty УТ11, КА2, УП2</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Объекты УТ11, КА2, УП2</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>TM11, PA2, EM2 nesneleri</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Đối tượng UT11, KA2, UP2</value>
  </synonym>
  <explanation>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Technological subsystem.
It includes objects which belong to the TM11, PA2 and EM2 configurations.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>زیرسیستم فناوری.
شامل اشیایی است که به پیکربندی‌های TM11، PA2 و EM2 تعلق دارند.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Sottosistema tecnologico.
Include gli oggetti che appartengono solo alle configurazioni УТ11, КА2, УП2.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Podsystem technologiczny. 
 Zawiera obiekty, związane z konfiguracjami УТ11, КА2, УП2.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Технологическая подсистема.
Включает в себя объекты, относящиеся к конфигурациям УТ11, КА2, УП2.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Teknolojik alt sistem.
TM11, PA2, EM2 konfigürasyonları ile ilgili nesneleri içerir.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Phân hệ công nghệ.
Bao gồm các đối tượng liên quan đến cấu hình của UT11, KA2, UP2.</value>
  </explanation>
